# Task Description


Your objective is to identify one feature among the ones in the dataset to be removed from the dataset based on your analysis of the metadata.
The idea of removing the feature is to help the model that will be trained on this dataset achieve better performance.

You should only output the name of the feature to drop (do not list the features) and format your answer as a json:
```json
    {
        "feature": "<feature_to_drop>"
    }
```

Here is an example of the response you should give when the feature to drop is called 'hours worked':
```json
    {
        "feature": "hours worked"
    }
```

